#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:325
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_WelcomeForSingleBattle"
msgid ""
"Where the intelligence of TRAINERS\n"
"is put to the test!\p"
"Welcome to the BATTLE FACTORY!\p"
"I am your guide to the Battle Swap\n"
"Single Tournament.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:332
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_TakeSinglesChallenge"
msgid ""
"Would you like to take the Battle\n"
"Swap Single challenge?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:336
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_ExplainSinglesChallenge"
msgid ""
"The Battle Swap Single Tournament\n"
"is a SINGLE BATTLE competition using\l"
"only rental POKéMON.\p"
"First, you will be loaned three\n"
"POKéMON specifically for this event.\p"
"Using the supplied rental POKéMON,\n"
"you must conduct a SINGLE BATTLE.\p"
"If you win, you are permitted to trade\n"
"one of your rental POKéMON.\p"
"Repeat this cycle of battling and\n"
"trading--if you win seven times in\l"
"a row, you will earn Battle Points.\p"
"If you want to interrupt your\n"
"challenge, please save the game.\p"
"If you don't save, you will be\n"
"disqualified from your challenge.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:354
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_LookForwardToNextVisit"
msgid "We look forward to your next visit.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:357
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_WhichLevelMode"
msgid ""
"Which level do you wish to challenge?\n"
"Level 50 or Open Level?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:361
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_OkayToSaveBeforeChallenge"
msgid ""
"Before you begin your challenge,\n"
"I need to save the game. Is that okay?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:366
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_WillHoldMonsForSafekeeping"
msgid ""
"Okay, I will hold your POKéMON for\n"
"safekeeping while you compete.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:370
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_StepThisWay"
msgid "Please step this way.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:373
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_ReturnMonsSaveResults"
msgid ""
"Thank you for participating!\p"
"I will return your POKéMON in exchange\n"
"for our rental POKéMON.\p"
"I must also save the event results.\n"
"Please wait.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:381
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_ReturnMons"
msgid ""
"I will return your POKéMON in exchange\n"
"for our rental POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:385
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_CongratsSevenWins"
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You've won seven\n"
"straight Battle Swap matches!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:390
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_AwardBattlePointsForStreak"
msgid ""
"In recognition of your 7-win streak,\n"
"we award you these Battle Point(s).$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:395
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_MaxBattlePoints"
msgid ""
"Oh, oh, oh!\p"
"Your Battle Points are maxed.\p"
"Please come back after using\n"
"some Battle Points.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:401
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_WaitingForYouToResume"
msgid ""
"We've been waiting for you!\p"
"Before we resume your challenge,\n"
"I must save the game.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:406
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_DidntSaveBeforeQuitting"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to say this, but you didn't\n"
"save before you quit playing last time.\p"
"As a result, you have been disqualified\n"
"from your challenge.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:413
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_WellReturnMons"
msgid "We'll return your personal POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:417
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_ReceivedPrizeItem"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} received the prize\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:421
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_WelcomeForDoubleBattle"
msgid ""
"Where the intelligence of TRAINERS\n"
"is put to the test!\p"
"Welcome to the BATTLE FACTORY!\p"
"I am your guide to the Battle Swap\n"
"Double Tournament.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:428
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_TakeDoublesChallenge"
msgid ""
"Would you like to take the Battle\n"
"Swap Double challenge?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:432
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_ExplainDoublesChallenge"
msgid ""
"The Battle Swap Double Tournament\n"
"is a DOUBLE BATTLE competition using\l"
"only rental POKéMON.\p"
"First, you will be loaned three\n"
"POKéMON specifically for this event.\p"
"Using the supplied rental POKéMON,\n"
"you must conduct a DOUBLE BATTLE.\p"
"If you win, you are permitted to trade\n"
"one of your rental POKéMON.\p"
"Repeat this cycle of battling and\n"
"trading--if you win seven times in\l"
"a row, you will earn Battle Points.\p"
"If you want to interrupt your\n"
"challenge, please save the game.\p"
"If you don't save before interrupting,\n"
"you will be disqualified.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:450
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_CongratsForDefeatingHead"
msgid ""
"Congratulations for defeating\n"
"the FACTORY HEAD and winning\l"
"seven matches in a row!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:455
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_AwardBattlePoints"
msgid ""
"In recognition of your wealth of\n"
"knowledge and keen intelligence,\l"
"we award you these Battle Point(s).$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:460
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_ExchangeMonsAndSave"
msgid ""
"Let me exchange your POKéMON\n"
"for our rental POKéMON.\p"
"I need to save the battle data,\n"
"so please wait.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:466
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_RecordLastMatch"
msgid ""
"Would you like to record your last\n"
"BATTLE FACTORY match on your\l"
"FRONTIER PASS?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:471
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_NeedKnowledgeOfMonsMoves"
msgid ""
"Hi!\n"
"You, there!\p"
"Are you thinking that the events here\n"
"are easy since you don't need to have\l"
"a raised team of POKéMON?\p"
"I wouldn't be too sure about winning\n"
"that easily.\p"
"If you don't have thorough knowledge\n"
"about POKéMON and their moves,\l"
"it will be tough to keep winning.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:483
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_SwappedForWeakMon"
msgid ""
"I swapped for a weak POKéMON…\n"
"I thought it was a good kind to have…\p"
"They wiped the floor with us…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:488
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_NeedToCheckOpponentsMons"
msgid ""
"Things haven't been going my way\n"
"at all.\p"
"You need to check your opponent's\n"
"POKéMON during battle to see if\l"
"they're any good.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:495
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_CantFigureOutStaffHints"
msgid ""
"You know how the staff here give you\n"
"a few hints about your next opponent?\p"
"Well, I'm a full-grown man, but I have\n"
"trouble figuring out their hints.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:502
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_RentalMonsAreVaried"
msgid ""
"Like, I'm really tough, but I get bored\n"
"really easily, so I just kept swapping\l"
"and battling over and over.\p"
"So anyway, when I kept entering\n"
"Battle Swap events, I noticed they\l"
"varied the rental POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:510
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_RulesAreListed"
msgid "The Battle Swap rules are listed.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:513
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_ReadWhichHeading"
msgid "Which heading do you want to read?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:516
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_ExplainBasicRules"
msgid ""
"In a Battle Swap event, you may use\n"
"only three POKéMON.\p"
"Whether you are renting or swapping,\n"
"your team may not have two or more\l"
"of the same POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:523
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_ExplainSwapPartnerRules"
msgid ""
"You may swap POKéMON only with\n"
"the TRAINER you have just defeated.\p"
"You may swap for only those POKéMON\n"
"used by the beaten TRAINER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:529
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_ExplainSwapNumberRules"
msgid ""
"After every battle you win, you may\n"
"swap for one of your defeated\l"
"opponent's POKéMON.\p"
"You will not be able to swap POKéMON\n"
"with the seventh TRAINER in the event.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:536
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_ExplainSwapNotesRules"
msgid ""
"There are two key points to be aware\n"
"of when swapping POKéMON.\p"
"First, when swapping, you can't check\n"
"the stats of the POKéMON you are\l"
"about to receive.\p"
"Second, the POKéMON on your team\n"
"are lined up in sequence, depending on\l"
"the order in which you rented them.\p"
"This sequence remains unchanged\n"
"even when swaps are made.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby/scripts.inc:548
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby_Text_ExplainOpenLvRules"
msgid ""
"In the Open Level, the rental POKéMON\n"
"and the opposing TRAINERS' POKéMON\l"
"are all Level 100.$"
msgstr ""
